<title>
Tire Placard Description
</title>
<ptxt>
The “Tire Placard” is located on the driver’s side door lock pillar and should be referred to for tire information.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
The placard lists the tire size, rim size, spare tire size and cold tire pressure.
</ptxt>
